PATCH 512: the cockpit-view reset event 7f29.

asm 0x7f29-0x7f3d, dispatched by the 2057 display-list walk:
    7f29: 80 0e 84 8f 25  orb  [0x8f84],0x25    ; a BYTE or -- DAT_2000_4f84 is typed undefined2, so the
                                                ; decompile's `| 0x25` also wrote DGROUP:0x8f85
    7f2e: 8b 3e 34 6d     mov  di,[0x6d34]      ; the PLAYER's NEAR OFFSET
    7f32: c6 85 a0 00 00  movb [di+0xa0],0
    7f37: e8 f1 2a        call 0xaa2b           ; DI live
    7f3a: e8 7e a3        call 0x22bb

DAT_2000_2d34 holds the player's near offset (patch 300) and was dereferenced as a host pointer.
7f29 is the top SIGSEGV of the post-511 sweep on AZER3/AZER5/AZER6/CYPRUS1/CYPRUS3/CYPRUS4/CYPRUS5
(7f29 <- 2057 <- 2032).
